 rose gold saree in cutwork weave with floral motifs","width":3000,"height":4500,"src":"/reference-only/products/nayanika-rosegold-organza-embroidered-saree/02.jpg"}],"narrative":"Rose gold is a colour that goes wrong easily — a shade too warm and it is orange, a shade too cool and it is nothing. This one was dyed three times before the third bath held. The embroidery is worked after weaving, in a thread only half a step off the ground, so the pattern arrives late and stays quiet.","spec":{"colour":"Rose gold","technique":"Hand embroidery on handwoven organza","fabric":"Banaras organza","speciality":"Tonal thread, no zari anywhere on the piece","collectionNote":"From Awadh."},"provenance":{"workshop":"Madanpura workshop","loom":"Pit loom, plain weave","weaveTimeWeeks":10,"artisanCount":4},"garmentType":"saree","weave":"cutwork","fabric":"kora-organza","colourFamily":"pink","zariTypes":["resham"],"motifs":["bel","floral"]}}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-center","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-[1.375rem] leading-none tracking-[0.06em] text-ink","children":["$","$L24",null,{"href":"/products/nayanika-rosegold-organza-embroidered-saree","className":"after:absolute after:inset-0","children":"Nayanika"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-caption mx-auto mt-2 line-clamp-2 max-w-[34ch] text-ink-muted","children":"Rose Gold Organza Hand-Embroidered Saree"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 text-[0.9375rem] tabular-nums tracking-[0.02em] text-ink","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"tabular-nums ","children":"₹66,000"}]}]]}]]}]}]
